WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.769 --> 00:00:10.244 size:53% position:73% line:53%
planétarium. Mais d'abord pour

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:11.278 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nous mettre la table, reportage

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:12.279 size:53% position:73% line:53%
